MerkleAdapterSettlement
├── when an authenticated report matures withdrawals
│   ├── it immediately exposes the released amount through deallocatable
│   └── it preserves total assets while moving NAV into reserves
├── when a later report is rejected
│   └── it preserves matured reserves, accepted NAV, nonce and cutoff
├── given withdrawals queued on both sides of a cutoff
│   ├── it preserves both claims through partial payouts and repeated idle reports
│   └── it transfers each released unit to the vault exactly once
└── given an authenticated loss and an in-flight report
    ├── it preserves post-snapshot deposits and cancellation payouts
    ├── it caps new withdrawal availability to the surviving backing
    └── it incorporates surviving deferred allocations in the following report
